('Ayu', 31, 'Kadın', 'Fark etmez', 'Endonezya', 'Bandung', 'id', 'Evliliğe hazırım', 'İstiyorum', 'Çok önemli', 'Uygun', 'Mimar', '{"tr":"Aile odaklıyım. Seyahat etmeyi, kahve ve sakin hafta sonlarını seviyorum.","id":"Saya dekat dengan keluarga. Saya suka bepergian, kopi, dan akhir pekan yang tenang.","en":"I am family-oriented. I enjoy travel, coffee and calm weekends.","zh":"我重视家庭，喜欢旅行、咖啡和安静的周末。","th":"ฉันให้ความสำคัญกับครอบครัว ชอบท่องเที่ยว กาแฟ และวันหยุดที่เงียบสงบ"}'::jsonb, '[["prompt_marriage",{"tr":"Saygı, açık iletişim ve iki ailenin de huzurlu hissetmesi.","id":"Rasa hormat, komunikasi terbuka, dan kedua keluarga merasa nyaman.","en":"Respect, open communication and both families feeling at ease.","zh":"尊重、坦诚沟通，以及双方家庭都感到安心。","th":"ความเคารพ การสื่อสารที่เปิดใจ และทั้งสองครอบครัวรู้สึกสบายใจ"}],["prompt_weekend",{"tr":"Yeni bir kahveci, kısa bir yürüyüş ve aileyle akşam yemeği.","id":"Mencoba kedai kopi baru, jalan santai, lalu makan malam bersama keluarga.","en":"A new coffee shop, a short walk and dinner with family.","zh":"一家新咖啡馆、一次散步，再和家人共进晚餐。","th":"ร้านกาแฟใหม่ เดินเล่นสั้นๆ แล้วทานข้าวเย็นกับครอบครัว"}]]'::jsonb, '{"communication":"direct","planning":"planned","social":"balanced","conflict":"calm","money":"planned"}'::jsonb, array['Bahasa Indonesia','English']::text[], 1),
